OL,3,AUS Supreme Court allows execution of
OL,4,AChrista Pike to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was 18 when she and her
OL,7,Fthen-boyfriend, Tadaryl Shipp, beat,
OL,8,Ftortured and killed the 19-year-old,
OL,9,Fwhom they met at a job training camp
OL,10,Ffor troubled teens.
